0.006 - 2026-10-29
  - Server:
     - Fix ability to run Mojo server mounted at a deeper path than '/'
     - Fix ability to serve branch and tag names containing '/'
     - Add canonical ~branch/, ~tag/, and ~commit/ paths
     - Resolve friendly tree paths to these canonical paths before routing
       so that Mojo's URL caching doesn't hide changes in available git refs.

0.005 - 2026-10-29
  - Declare missing dependency on Log::Any::Adapter::MojoLog
  - Suppress ssl-related crash on FreeBSD from tests, since the bug
    needs fixed upstream in Git::Raw.

0.004 - 2026-10-28
  - Fix ability for commands to update the index of the working branch
  - Server:
     - Serve an index page for the whole repository, optionally listing
       available branches
     - Serve an index page for each archive tree, browsing or filtering
       the module list, and javascript feature to compare the list to the
       CVE database.

0.003 - 2026-01-14
  - cpangit-add can now process cpanfile or cpanfile.snapshot
  - New method ArchiveTree->import_cpanfile_snapshot
  - Support for backpan via MirrorTree->upstream_backup_url

0.002 - 2025-12-19
  - Sort 02packages.details.txt case-insensitive so that it works with
    binary search required by CPAN::02Packages::Search used by App::cpm
  - Server:
      - Refresh cache if a branch receives new commits
      - Limit cache to 20 trees (LRU) when Tree::RB::XS is available
      - Fix bugs in ability to generate .tar.gz files from dist dir

0.001 - 2025-12-16
  - Initial mostly-usable release
